(D) PROVEN ROW 7 (columns m=1..4 from proved column GFs; diag from A088368)
========================================================================
  column forms reproduce known triangle (m<=4): True
  t(7,1..4) = 1, 63, 1155, 8617   t(7,7)=A088368(7)=21477
  C_7=429;  signed-sum identity =>  t(7,6) - t(7,5) = 13524
